{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10126080","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10126080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1012608001:1":{"text":"이 사람들이 저와 아빠를 구했어요. 정말 좋은 사람들이에요!","source_cn":"这些人救了我和阿爸，他们是好人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE94295719884F6D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012608002:1":{"text":"정말 미안해요. 조금 전엔 너무 놀라서... 실례를 범했네요.","source_cn":"真对不起，我刚才是被吓破胆了……所以才失礼的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x110AF1D3E254A696","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012608003:0":{"text":"아니에요, 방금 당신의 눈빛은 정말 저를 예언의 아이라고 생각한 것 같았어요. 하하...","source_cn":"不，你刚才的眼神，真的把我当成预言之子似的，哈哈……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67BFF336068B6ED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012608004:2":{"text":"그만해. 다 웃었어? 더 이상 웃으면 실례야.","source_cn":"好啦，笑够了没有，再笑就是你失礼了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x934790530B7DFEFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1012608005:0":{"text":"아니에요. 만약 좋은 예언이라면 정말 믿고 싶어요.","source_cn":"没什么，如果预言是好的，我愿意相信。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x169D25BAB1ED9ED1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1012608006:2":{"text":"베르나, 무사해서 다행이구나. 모두와 만나게 해주겠니?","source_cn":"维娜，能见到你无事太好了，让我见见大家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0853FB990BDB789A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1012608007:0":{"text":"마을 주민들이 많이 다쳤어요. 켈빈도 약초를 구한다고 급히 나가는 바람에 말릴 틈도 없었고요.","source_cn":"很多村民都负伤了，凯尔温也是急着要去采药草才出去的，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E3686EF5602C8CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1012608008:0":{"text":"멀린 님, 일행을 이끌고 이미르를 계속 쫓아가세요.","source_cn":"梅林，你带着大家继续追赶伊米尔。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x317DD5A249B687A8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"멀린 님, 일행을 이끌고 이미르를 계속 쫓아가세요.","female":"멀린 님, 일행을 이끌고 이미르를 계속 쫓아가세요.","variant_male_record_index":"111893","variant_female_record_index":"111894","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1012608009:0":{"text":"그럼 넌?","source_cn":"那你呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB26D0A531C95D97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1012608010:0":{"text":"이 근처엔 아직 몬스터가 많아서 이 마을 주민들만으로는 약초를 모으지 못할 거야.","source_cn":"附近的魔物还有很多，光靠这些村民是没办法集齐药草的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76A11176D65301F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1012608011:0":{"text":"예언의 아이가 갑자기 떠나는 건 좋지 않은데. 안 그래요, 멀린 님?","source_cn":"预言之子忽然离开可不太好吧，你说呢？梅林。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5DA3B43CF3D4FE04","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"예언의 아이가 갑자기 떠나는 건 좋지 않은데. 안 그래요, 멀린 님?","female":"예언의 아이가 갑자기 떠나는 건 좋지 않은데. 안 그래요, 멀린 님?","variant_male_record_index":"111897","variant_female_record_index":"111898","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1012608011":{"text":"예언의 아이가 갑자기 떠나는 건 좋지 않은데. 안 그래요, 멀린 님?","source_cn":"预言之子忽然离开可不太好吧，你说呢？梅林。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5DA3B43CF3D4FE04","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"예언의 아이가 갑자기 떠나는 건 좋지 않은데. 안 그래요, 멀린 님?","female":"예언의 아이가 갑자기 떠나는 건 좋지 않은데. 안 그래요, 멀린 님?","variant_male_record_index":"111897","variant_female_record_index":"111898","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1012608012:2":{"text":"에이론, 급하다는 건 알지만 흩어지지 않으려면 이게 가장 빠른 것 같습니다.","source_cn":"埃隆，我们知道你很着急，但以防走散，这样的确是最快的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7512BB94C12B15D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1012608015:0":{"text":"그럼... 어서 출발하도록 하죠.","source_cn":"那好……我们尽快出发吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA88D38EF6BCF229A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:18:0:1":{"text":"함께 약초를 모은 다음 떠나자","source_cn":"我们一起采集完再启程","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC383FAD8B50EE2AD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"함께 약초를 모은 다음 떠나자","female":"함께 약초를 모은 다음 떠나자","variant_male_record_index":"61600","variant_female_record_index":"61601","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1012608013:2":{"text":"하, 맞아요! 당신이 진짜 예언의 아이라는 걸 인정해야겠네요!","source_cn":"哈，是的！我得承认你才是真正的预言之子！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE3B6D5C3C3CD7121","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"하, 맞아요! 당신이 진짜 예언의 아이라는 걸 인정해야겠네요!","female":"하, 맞아요! 당신이 진짜 예언의 아이라는 걸 인정해야겠네요!","variant_male_record_index":"111900","variant_female_record_index":"111901","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1012608014:2":{"text":"후... 둘이 친한 이유를 알겠네요...","source_cn":"呼……怪不得你们私交这么好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDDF40E1B4BB8540","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:18:1:2":{"text":"내가 예언의 아이 멀린이야!","source_cn":"我是预言之子梅林","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5F16F9E61949AB39","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"내가 예언의 아이 멀린이야!","female":"내가 예언의 아이 멀린이야!","variant_male_record_index":"61602","variant_female_record_index":"61603","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:凯尔温":{"text":"켈빈","source":"凯尔温","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维娜":{"text":"베르나","source":"维娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:村长伊凡":{"text":"촌장 이반","source":"村长伊凡","st